    /// Enqueue (without waiting) FP16 K + FP32 V -> FP4 paged KV append for all
    /// KV heads. V is rounded to f16 inside the kernel before FP4 scale/packing
    /// to preserve the previous cast_f32_f16 -> append numerics.
