    /// [`GpuDevice::arm_cast_qk_rope_append_paged_fp4_vf32_q64_k4_d128_meta`],
    /// dispatched over 32 workgroups instead of 68 because OLMo 2 is 16 query
    /// heads over 16 KV heads rather than 64 over 4.
    ///
    /// The caller must pass `q_w` and `k_w` spanning the whole projection
    /// (`heads * 128` elements each), not a single 128-wide vector. OLMo 2
    /// normalises across the projection, so each head reads its own slice.
